---@field timestamp string When the exception happened.
---@field type string|distilled.Null The exception type, such as TypeError.
---@field value string|distilled.Null The exception message.
---@field frames posthog.error_tracking.MissingSymbolsExampleExceptionFramesList The stack trace, most recent call first, cut to the frames nearest the crash.

